[Desktop Entry]
# Orion-X GODSEYE globe (DEC-PHASE12-045). Opens the PREFLIGHT, never the
# globe: every GODSEYE layer is a live third-party API, and on a deck with no
# route the globe renders a featureless sphere that reads as "nothing is
# happening". orionx-osint refuses to serve the bundle at all at a raised
# posture or with no default route.
Type=Application
Name=GODSEYE (globe)
GenericName=Live situational globe — network required
Comment=3-D globe of live public feeds; refuses to open at a raised posture or with no route, and lists every host it would contact
Exec=/usr/bin/orionx-osint --page godseye
Icon=/usr/share/pixmaps/orionx.png
Terminal=true
Categories=X-Orion;
Keywords=godseye;globe;cesium;ADS-B;satellites;situational awareness;OSINT;
